    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>猫咪亮相～～～</span></p><span></span><p><span>叁叁家的：毛毛和皮皮，英短，母女俩</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FusWWw8cIm51btBTVYWzdNXSFtj6.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/Fqb86uli_De8w-DG3ADCyhPytHqL.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>豆豆家的：豆包，布偶猫，有三个准媳妇</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FgkKNtujh-wR8GLj6BErRsboFBWz.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>田田家的：玻璃胃的妹妹（金吉拉），超粘人的timi（英短）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FqypfQAdNVwbQm-neq_fF6BEuwxJ.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/Fh8zagylwFi2U2e8sOjmfXCkpcHT.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="212">03:32</a> ：我的猫从精神上养了我，猫咪的治愈瞬间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="880">14:40</a> ：养猫那些令人抓狂的时刻，我们一般怎样处理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1803">30:03</a> ：破除养猫迷思，对养猫新手的建议和经验分享</span></p><span></span><p><span>（更正一下～8月8日不是爱猫日而是“世界猫咪日”哈，嘴瓢嘴瓢）</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：告五人《给你一瓶魔法药水》</span></p>]]></description>
